d are actively tracking their  whereabouts local activist jamal taylor  helped the family raise over 250  thousand dollars through gofundme  for the family to hire its own  investigators and get a second autopsy  i was particularly disappointed by the  the lack of response from police in the  matter  and so i immediately said we need to do  something about this it shouldn't be  incumbent upon the family to solve the  crime of quan charles  family members are now drawing  similarities between charles injuries  and emmett tills  in 1955 two white men murdered 14 year  old till  for allegedly whistling at a white woman  in mississippi  his casket was left opened at his  mother's request  so the world could see the brutality the  charles family released a photo of kawan  to show the world what he looked like  when he was found  what made you all release that image  well we felt like the world needed to  see  we have opted not to show that image of  kawan due to the graphic  nature and also the ongoing  investigation now the sheriff's office  that is investigating this case did  release a statement this weekend saying  they have video of kawan apparently  walking alone around the time of his  disappearance  but they have not released that video to  the public  we also reached out to janet irvin and  have not heard a response back gail  boyd eureka just reading about the  injuries that was done to quan  made me nauseous or i have mixed  feelings about showing that picture we  know it made a difference in the emmett  till case  but do you know if the urbans had any  connection to this this young man  they didn't know each other that they  did not know this family the  the family kawan's parents say they did  not know this woman  they did not know the son they don't  understand how this happened and  ultimately they want answers yeah we  want more answers and they were hoping  that the police they said did  more early on in this that's what they  were hoping yeah this story